English.Char_Desc_2000:
AIGraph CAD Viewer is carefully designed for non-CAD users to view,print CAD files. It's not only a CAD file viewer, but a professional CAD file working platform.Batch CAD file converter is the key functions of AIGraph CAD Viewer. Full set of PDF file properties are supported.With AIGraph CAD Viewer, you can export any CAD file to PDF, SVG or image file.

Features include:
1   Open DWG file, version from 2.5 to 2010;
2   Open DXF file;
3   Files opened with multiple tabbed windows;
4   Paper Space / Model Space displayed in different tabbed view window;
5   DWG layouts support;
6   View, print, save, convert via the command line.
7   Supports DWG/DXF Viewports
8   Multiple CAD files selection via File Open or Windows Explorer
9   Support any number of files to convert;
10  DWG layouts support;
11  Convert via the command line;
12  Conversion process report;
13  Embedded the font of CAD file into PDF;
14  Convert Truetype font to geometry;
15  Convert SHX font to geometry;
16  Export any part of views as you pick;
17  Support hidden linke removal;
18  Standard PDF properties: Title,Author, Subject,Keywords, Creator, Producer;
19  Support hidden line;
20  Support blended gradients color;
21  Customise Image base for SVG;
22  User defined Image URL;
23  Support any image type in SVG file;
24  Lightweight scale value;
25  Support user defined floating point precise;
26  Upgrade continuously!
